  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3307.02 Recordkeeping and Reporting Requirements for Small MWC Units",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3307.02 Recordkeeping and Reporting Requirements for Small MWC Units.\n\n(a) Small MWC units shall comply with the recordkeeping requirements specified in the following:\n\n(1) 40 CFR §60.1830;\n\n(2) 40 CFR §60.1835;\n\n(3) 40 CFR §60.1840;\n\n(4) 40 CFR §60.1845;\n\n(5) 40 CFR §60.1850; and\n\n(6) 40 CFR §60.1855.\n\n(b) Small MWC units shall comply with the reporting requirements specified in the following:\n\n(1) 40 CFR §60.1860;\n\n(2) 40 CFR §60.1865;\n\n(3) 40 CFR §60.1870;\n\n(4) 40 CFR §60.1875;\n\n(5) 40 CFR §60.1880;\n\n(6) 40 CFR §60.1885;\n\n(7) 40 CFR §60.1890;\n\n(8) 40 CFR §60.1895;\n\n(9) 40 CFR §60.1900; and\n\n(10) 40 CFR §60.1905.\n\nSource. #7704, eff 6-7-02; ss by #9084, eff 2-2-08; ss by #11131, eff 7-18-16; ss by #12628, eff 9-27-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3300.html"
